  responses: "Muslim apologists say the Comforter is a human prophet because Jesus says 'if I go not away, the Comforter will not come' (John 16:7), and that Muhammad fulfilled 'he will guide you into all truth.'",
  followups: ["Could Muhammad 'dwell in' the disciples or be sent 'in Jesus' name'?"],
